    <mxCell id="note2" value="&lt;b&gt;JWT Payload:&lt;/b&gt; sub(userId), roles[], iss, iat, exp&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Algorithm:&lt;/b&gt; RS256 (RSA Private Key ký, Public Key xác minh)" style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Times New Roman;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="450" y="545" width="490" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

